        "id": "md_5"
      },
      "source": [
        "There is a heavy class imbalance with about 72.05% of the force type used being bodily force. To help reduce this class imbalance, I will combine some of the categories in force type (the target variable). We decided to group the following together:\n",
        "\n",
        "-Bodily force: \"Bodily Force\" and \"Maximal Restraint Technique\"\n",
        "\n",
        "-Chemical irritant: \"Chemical Irritant\"\n",
        "\n",
        "-Less-lethal weapons: \"Less Lethal Projectile\", \"Baton\", \"Less Lethal\", \"Taser\", \"Improvised Weapon\", \"Police K9 Bite\"\n",
        "\n",
        "-Guns: \"Gun Point Display\" and \"Firearm\"\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        " This combined the force types into 4 total categories, as shown below.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 13,
      "id": "code_6",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "code_6",
        "colab": {
