    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "md_17",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "md_17"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Bayesian Model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "md_18",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "md_18"
      },
      "source": [
        "For the portion I am coding, I use a Bayesian model for analysis.\n",
        "\n",
        "I chose the likelihood distribution for the target variable, ForceType, as normal distributions centered at 0 with a standard deviation of 1.\n",
        "\n",
        "The data in this csv is already cleaned (thank you Celia!) so we don't need to drop any data points with null values in this code."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "md_19",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "md_19"
      },
      "source": [
        "I encoded all of the categorical features to be integers. We can't one-hot encode for all of the features since they aren't binary. I encoded the problem group using TargetEncoder from sklearn.preprocessing since there were many problem types that were grouped and it would be difficult to one hot encode them. We need to label encode the features for Bayesian modeling since it looks up the parameters in indexes so I used LabelEncoder from sklearn.preprocessing for that.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Also, I split the data into a training and test set for cross validation (80% of the data in the training set and 20% in the test set)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 20,
      "id": "code_20",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "code_20",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "5f48aefb-8107-4e1e-9c32-482348f29cdd"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Number of observations in Guns training set (smallest force type class): 373\n",
            "ForceGroup\n",
            "Bodily force           373\n",
